   45,191 disposable plastic bottles and reduce 10,846 kg of related CO2
   emissions every year. Our study also showed a statistically significant
   increase in WTP and WTU WRS as we introduced more and more information
   about pro-environmental behaviors to students. This finding indicates
   the importance of information campaigning and learning how to encourage
   pro-environmental behavior.},
